# V3b (V3_PACKAGING_DESIGN §2): the vsix ships ONLY the bundled runtime
# (dist/), the bridge wheels + manifest (bridge-dist/), and the extension
# manifest/README, local engine archive, setup resources and guides.
# Everything below is development-only and never packaged.
src/**
test/**
node_modules/**
.vscode/**
dist-test/**
.vscode-test/**
esbuild.mjs
esbuild.test.mjs
tsconfig.json
**/*.map
**/*.ts
.gitignore

*.vsix.sha256

.mac-package-*/**

.local-package-*/**

**/__pycache__/**
**/*.pyc

# Only current end-user guides belong in the extension.
docs/**
!docs/local-models.md
!docs/local-models.ja.md
!docs/user-guide.md
!docs/user-guide.ja.md
**/.DS_Store
スクリーンショット*.png

# Local test files and screenshots are not extension assets.
**/*.c
**/*.c.*
sample_sensor.c

# The only C source shipped is the user-facing practice template.
!resources/quick-start.c
